{
  "name": "Post to social media with Ampost",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Post to social media with Ampost\n### How it works\nPublishes one post to every platform you list, through the Ampost node.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-ampost** (tested with 0.1.1): Settings → Community nodes → Install, as in the [n8n guide](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/community-nodes/installation/). Until n8n verifies it, the node needs self-hosted n8n.\n2. Create an Ampost credential with an API key from [ampost.io](https://ampost.io/?ref=n8n) → Settings → API keys.\n3. In **Post content**, set `text` and `platforms` (comma-separated: bluesky, threads, linkedin, twitter, instagram, facebook, tiktok, youtube, pinterest, telegram, discord). Each needs a connected account in Ampost.\n4. Click **Test workflow**.\n\nThe Idempotency-Key makes a retried request post once. Swap **Run it** for any trigger.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "e6349483-5374-4352-a132-cecd394c310a",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "e81da8c3-03c3-4b5e-abc9-f00ce3efd022",
      "name": "Run it",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "71ecc67a-a6ee-497b-a4f1-f5ed3c7a813d",
              "name": "text",
              "value": "Hello from n8n and Ampost!",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "1dff2cb1-5784-488f-a260-abc608d68519",
              "name": "platforms",
              "value": "bluesky,threads",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e8402075-06a0-4a08-a9d1-ca6934c16963",
              "name": "link",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "bf858474-dc95-4b3a-aebe-12e0f7fd3481",
      "name": "Post content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "platforms": "={{ $json.platforms.split(',').map(p => p.trim()).filter(p => p) }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "idempotencyKey": "=n8n-{{ $execution.id }}-{{ $itemIndex }}",
          "linkUrl": "={{ $json.link }}"
        },
        "platformOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "fe8e4a44-43bb-407a-a5e7-7fce7ab435e4",
      "name": "Create post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ampost.ampost",
      "typeVersion": 1,
